{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1538102-amaranth-question","id":1538102,"title":"Amaranth question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-07-04T16:46:02-07:00","id":1538102,"title":"Amaranth question","content":"Have you ever had your player characters ever do the deed and lower there generation at all? I never did myself and to be fair in our game we play Anarchs that are around the 150+ mark and we tend to be either 11th or 12th generation and not to many low generation elders or ancillae are around in the setting and we would be hard pressed to find an active 4th-6th generation kindred in general as they are quite reclusive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-06T10:18:49-07:00","id":1538175,"title":"","content":"I mean you may not find a 4th or 6th gen, but it can't be that hard to find a 9th or 8th gen. The power difference between a 10th and 9th is pretty huge given the increase in the amount of blood spent per turn.<br /> <br /> Have committed it as a player and allowed it in game. One of my players has had such terrible luck doing it. He's failed the willpower roll one time and got a derangement and frenzy, and botched the other one and lost the character to the clash of wills.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5617-vendrin","name":"Vendrin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5617_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-06T10:56:36-07:00","id":1538176,"title":"","content":"No it wouldn't be as in our game that most visible movers and shakers of kindred society are members of the 7th-11th generations and in our city the lowest generation Kindred is a member of the 8th and there is two 9th generation NPC's hanging about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-06T20:53:47-07:00","id":1538190,"title":"","content":"I tend to play without Generation and err towards using Blood Potency, which to get past 5 you need to eat a vampire of equal or higher Blood Potency. Having played this multiple times, I love it. Elders suddenly become paranoid as fuck and drop out of public society, all the whole hunting their own kin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27252-hades","name":"Hades","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-06T21:12:16-07:00","id":1538193,"title":"","content":"To be fair elders and ancients tend to paranoid of younger vampires in general as there powerful blood could be a enticement to hunt them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-06T21:25:46-07:00","id":1538194,"title":"","content":"Yeah, so that's definitely true. We made that change years ago because you always had Session Zero be &quot;Okay, so everyone is 8th Gen again?&quot; We tied Blood Potency to the lowest of the character's Clan Disciplines and found the game took a *serious* dramatic turn as players bought their 5th dot in their last Clan Discipline. Suddenly, they even stopped trusting each other completely, all the while they started hunting vampires they've heard of who previously disappeared over the years. <br /> <br /> While Elders and especially low generation Elders have always been hunted and been fearful of being hunted, we've found this change exacerbated it, because it so drastically changed the dynamic of your existence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27252-hades","name":"Hades","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}